    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【📖本期概览】</span></p><span></span><p><span>辛苦👨🏻‍🌾一☝🏻年📆了，喜欢💕的东西🎁一样没🙅🏻‍♂️舍得买💸，好像🤔什么🤷🏻‍♂️都来不及⏲️，又好像🤔什么🤷🏻‍♂️都无能为力🛌，没有🙂‍↔️期待🥰，只有迷茫😶‍🌫️和内心🫀的孤独🤦🏻‍♂️…俗话说📣：“一年🗓️之计👨🏻‍💻在于春🌱，一日🌅之计👨🏻‍💻在于晨🍳”，新年🎊伊始🔛，万物🐘可期🥰，晨间🕖烟🚬火🔥气💨，最抚🫂牛🐄马🐎心💓。就让新年🌏第一🥇缕阳光☀️，洒在🛀🏻热气🍲腾腾♨️的早餐🍱上，愿🙏🏻2️⃣0️⃣2️⃣5️⃣年每一个♻️清晨🖼️，都能🛎️治愈🛝我们🧇循环🥨往复🥯的日常🧀。</span></p><span></span><p><span>•••••••••••••</span></p><span></span><p><span>【⏰本期时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a> 早饭起源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 广东早茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a> 川A早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> 南北煎饼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 京城早膳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:09</a> 古早馄饨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3069">51:09</a> 科技羊杂碎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a> 时髦小早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3954">65:54</a> 病号早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4370">72:50</a> 稀的干的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5061">84:21</a> 其他城市的早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5548">92:28</a> 其他国家的早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6018">100:18</a> 酒店的早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6401">106:41</a> 鸡蛋和早午餐</span></p><span></span><p><span>•••••••••••••</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🏆我们是】</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播：山总/刘老师/飞哥/翠西</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤩录音：山总</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧏🏻‍♂️制作：山总</span></p><span></span><p><span>🥳文案：飞哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>•••••••••••••</span></p><span></