    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🪩🥳新一期节目上线啦🥳🪩</span></p><span></span><p><span>•••••••••••••</span></p><span></span><p><span>【👁️‍🗨️本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟 消除偏见 | 你吃苦耐劳，我大手大脚，两代人终于分道扬镳 - Vol.033</span></p><span></span><p><span>•••••••••••••</span></p><span></span><p><span>【📖本期概览】</span></p><span></span><p><span>近段📅时间🕰️，👨🏻‍🦳老一辈🧓🏻「没苦🥬硬吃👅」与👱🏻‍♂️年轻人👱🏻‍♀️「没福💸硬享💆🏻‍♂️」的话题💬，在网上🛜引发热议🔥。有的👨🏻‍🦳老人🧓🏻生活💃🏻条件🍱不错☑️，却要省吃💱俭用🏧，最后🔜搞坏了🚷身子❤️‍🩹，钱💸也没⛓️‍💥省下来⤵️；而有的👱🏻‍♂️年轻人👱🏻‍♀️抱🫂着「生活🌇是用来🤹🏻享受的🧘🏻‍♂️」的想法💭，在有限的🔂条件下®️寻求🔭最大的🈵快乐🎊和满足💖。由于时代⏳背景🌌、生活🥗环境🪸、成长🦥经历🐾的大相🦣径庭🪼，大多数👨🏻‍🦳老一辈🧓🏻和👱🏻‍♂️年轻人👱🏻‍♀️在价值💵观念💡上确实有🚸很大的🎞️差异🚦，那么我们🗿该如何🎳看待👀「没苦🥬硬吃👅」与「没福💸硬享💆🏻‍♂️」现象📸，又🪆该如何📨处理🛠️这种行为🎮反差🥁呢？点开🫵🏻本期节目🎙️，听听🦻🏻几位主播🧑‍🧑‍🧒‍🧒又有🔞什么话🈲要说🧾…</span></p><span></span><p><span>•••••••••••••</span></p><span></span><p><span>【⏰本期时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 奇葩婆婆踩尺子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a> 翠西爸爸买桃子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 乱开空调过日子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 主题乐园金点子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> 家长总爱管孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> 如何理性下馆子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2969">49:29</a> 奢侈品店绷面子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a> 快餐打折钻空子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4063">67:43</a> 年轻花钱找乐子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4720">78:40</a> 过度消费使性子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5062">84:22</a> 互相理解换位子</span></p><span></span><p><span>•••••••••••••</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🏆我们是】</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播：山总/刘老师/翠西/飞哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤩录音：山总</span></p><span></span><p